<section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">真实用户反馈</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">听听用过的人怎么说</p>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"用了两周，头皮出油明显少了，以前上午洗下午就塌，现在能撑一整天。"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i></div>
          <div>
            <strong>张女士</strong>
            <span>油性头皮 · 使用1个月</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"头屑困扰好几年了，这块皂洗了半个月头屑少了很多，肩膀终于干净了。"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i></div>
          <div>
            <strong>李先生</strong>
            <span>头屑问题 · 使用2个月</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"怀孕后头皮变得敏感，这款皂没有香精味，洗着很安心，不刺激。"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i></div>
          <div>
            <strong>王女士</strong>
            <span>敏感头皮 · 使用3周</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.testimonials { padding: 80px 0; background: #f8f9f0; }
.testimonials-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.testimonial-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 32px 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.testimonial-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.stars { color: #f5a623; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
.testimonial-text { font-size: var(--body-size); color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic; }
.testimonial-author {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding-top: 16px;
  border-top: 1px solid #eee;
}
.author-avatar i { font-size: 36px; color: var(--brand); }
.testimonial-author strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; color: var(--brand-dark); }
.testimonial-author span { font-size: var(--caption-size); color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Testimonials" }]
}
{% endschema %}